Engram bundles two third-party fonts, each under its own licence. The MIT
licence in LICENSE covers this project's own source; it does not cover these.

  engram/assets/fonts/Fraunces.ttf
      Fraunces, SIL Open Font License 1.1
      Full text: engram/assets/fonts/OFL-Fraunces.txt

  engram/assets/fonts/Inter.ttf
      Inter, SIL Open Font License 1.1
      Full text: engram/assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt

Both are variable fonts, embedded rather than fetched at run time because the
app is offline-first and makes no network requests.
